  "response": "KAST is the K'UHUL Abstract Syntax Tree. It bridges frontend projections to XCFE. KastDocument carries nodes and edges with semantic hashing. Node kinds include Fold, Operation, Memory, Agent, Model. Edge kinds include Flow, Data, Call, Reference. The canonical bridge is: frontend -> KAST -> XCFE -> KUHUL pi -> SCXQ2.",
